  ('bea', '{"personId":"bea","theme":{"paper":"#FFD8C2","card":"#FFF4EC","ink":"#5A2A27","accent":"#E5482B","highlight":"#FFF1A8","texture":"grain","displayFont":"hand","wall":"grid","layout":"loose"},"sections":[{"kind":"intro","title":"three songs i’ve cried to in public","songs":[{"trackId":"feist-mushaboom","why":"produce aisle. the peppers saw everything."},{"trackId":"bon-iver-holocene","why":"the 506 streetcar. a man offered me a tissue."},{"trackId":"bss-anthems","why":"my own shop. i was arranging tulips."}],"stickers":[{"kind":"smile","color":"#FFF4EC","x":0.8,"y":-0.07,"size":51,"rotate":-9}]},{"kind":"pinned","title":"the one","trackId":"feist-mushaboom","note":"Back of the shop, the first winter I ran it alone, buckets everywhere. I played it to keep warm. A customer came in crying about something else and we both pretended."},{"kind":"wall","title":"the wall","trackIds":["feist-mushaboom","bss-anthems","metric-help-im-alive","alvvays-archie","phoebe-motion-sickness","bon-iver-holocene","sufjan-chicago","joni-a-case-of-you","big-thief-not"],"stickers":[{"kind":"flower","color":"#FFF1A8","x":0.55,"y":0.63,"size":71,"rotate":7}]},{"kind":"shelf","title":"sounds like a church you’d actually go to","trackIds":["bon-iver-holocene","sufjan-chicago","joni-a-case-of-you","big-thief-not"]},{"kind":"liner","title":"care instructions","notes":[{"text":"Tulips keep growing after you cut them. I think about that more than I should."},{"trackId":"phoebe-motion-sickness","text":"The meanest song I love. She’s so polite about it."}]},{"kind":"shelf","title":"for wrapping bouquets","trackIds":["feist-mushaboom","alvvays-archie","metric-help-im-alive","phoebe-motion-sickness"]},{"kind":"guestbook","title":"guestbook","entries":[{"fromId":"owen","trackId":"hip-bobcaygeon","why":"if you grew up here you already know. if you didn’t, this is the entrance exam."},{"fromId":"grace","trackId":"glenn-gould-aria","why":"you can hear him humming along. his engineers hated it. it’s