  ('farah', '{"personId":"farah","theme":{"paper":"#D5C8F0","card":"#F6F1FF","ink":"#1F3D2B","accent":"#D94F30","highlight":"#FFE066","texture":"ruled","displayFont":"typeBold","wall":"grid","layout":"pages"},"sections":[{"kind":"pinned","title":"THE PINNED RECORD","trackId":"mitski-my-love-mine","note":"The law library, exam week, 11 p.m. Two minutes and eighteen seconds. I gave myself exactly that long, then went back to torts.","stickers":[{"kind":"smile","color":"#D94F30","x":0.8600000000000001,"y":-0.05,"size":67,"rotate":15}]},{"kind":"intro","title":"THREE SONGS, BILLED IN SIX-MINUTE INCREMENTS","songs":[{"trackId":"mitski-my-love-mine","why":"efficient. devastating. under three minutes."},{"trackId":"sza-good-days","why":"for when the reading is done. so, rarely."},{"trackId":"weeknd-house-of-balloons","why":"i skip to 3:20. i’m aware of what i’m missing."}]},{"kind":"shelf","title":"SAD, BUT ON A SCHEDULE","trackIds":["mitski-my-love-mine","daniel-caesar-best-part","chappell-good-luck-babe","sza-good-days"]},{"kind":"wall","title":"THE WALL","trackIds":["mitski-my-love-mine","sza-good-days","chappell-good-luck-babe","weeknd-house-of-balloons","daniel-caesar-best-part"],"stickers":[{"kind":"flower","color":"#F6F1FF","x":0.5700000000000001,"y":0.53,"size":65,"rotate":-5}]},{"kind":"liner","title":"SUBMISSIONS","notes":[{"text":"I skip intros. I know. The defence rests."},{"trackId":"chappell-good-luck-babe","text":"The key change is the closing argument. Case dismissed."}]},{"kind":"guestbook","title":"VISITORS’ BOOK","entries":[{"fromId":"hana","trackId":"mbv-only-shallow","why":"turn it up until it stops being a song and becomes weather."},{"fromId":"wren","trackId":"bill-evans-peace-piece","why":"six minutes. put the phone down. (you’re holding the phone. i know.)"},{"fromId":"priya","trackId":"sidhu-295","why":"if you only ever hear one, make it this one. then call me."}]},{"kind":"recent","title":"LATELY","visibility":"hidden","trackIds":[]}]}'::jsonb, app.now_ms()),
  ('owen', '{"personId":"owen","theme":{"paper":"#EFE3C8","card":"#F9F3E5","ink":"#3B2A1E","accent":"#B33A2B","highlight":"#FFD23F","texture":"grain","displayFont":"serifBlack","wall":"grid","layout":"loose"},"sections":[{"kind":"pinned","title":"pinned","trackId":"hip-bobcaygeon","note":"A dock on Sturgeon Lake, August long weekend, somebody’s uncle’s radio. I was sixteen. Nobody said anything until it ended and then somebody said “again.”","stickers":[{"kind":"flower","color":"#F9F3E5","x":0.8200000000000001,"y":-0.05,"size":53,"rotate":3}]},{"kind":"intro","title":"the canadian content requirement","songs":[{"trackId":"hip-bobcaygeon","why":"not up for debate."},{"trackId":"neil-young-harvest-moon","why":"for the drive up, once you’re past barrie."},{"trackId":"rush-limelight","why":"yes, the drummer wrote the words. that’s the whole point."}]},{"kind":"wall","title":"on the wall","trackIds":["hip-bobcaygeon","neil-young-harvest-moon","rush-limelight","joni-a-case-of-you","wolf-parade-ill-believe","feist-mushaboom"],"stickers":[{"kind":"smile","color":"#B33A2B","x":0.65,"y":0.7,"size":55,"rotate":-13}]},{"kind":"shelf","title":"for the drive up","trackIds":["neil-young-harvest-moon","hip-bobcaygeon","joni-a-case-of-you","feist-mushaboom"]},{"kind":"liner","title":"lesson plans","notes":[{"text":"I play it for the Grade 10s every June. They don’t get it. They’re not supposed to yet."},{"trackId":"joni-a-case-of-you","text":"She drew a map of Canada on a bar coaster and made it a love song. Top that."}]},{"kind":"shelf","title":"songs i’ve played for a classroom of fifteen-year-olds","trackIds":["rush-limelight","wolf-parade-ill-believe","bss-anthems"]},{"kind":"guestbook","title":"guestbook","entries":[{"fromId":"theo","trackId":"american-football-never-meant","why":"you’ve seen the house on the cover. now hear why everyone’s so sad about it."},{"fromId":"tessa","trackId":"cameron-winter-love-takes-miles","why":"he sings like he’s remembering the words as they arrive. cited in my thesis (it isn’t)."}]},{"kind":"recent","title":"recently played","visibility":"shown","trackIds":["hip-bobcaygeon","neil-young-harvest-moon","rush-limelight","joni-a-case-of-you"]}]}'::jsonb, app.now_ms()),
  ('zainab', '{"personId":"zainab","theme":{"paper":"#1E1533","card":"#2C2148","ink":"#F7D9A0","accent":"#FF7A59","highlight":"#4B3A8C","texture":"grain","displayFont":"typeBold","wall":"grid","layout":"pages"},"sections":[{"kind":"pinned","title":"THE ONE","trackId":"mustafa-stay-alive","note":"The 320 night bus, 3 a.m., after a double. Just me and the driver. He turned his radio down, I think so I could hear mine. Neither of us mentioned it.","stickers":[{"kind":"flower","color":"#FFD23F","x":0.8700000000000001,"y":-0.05,"size":50,"rotate":-12}]},{"kind":"intro","title":"THREE FOR AFTER CLOSE","songs":[{"trackId":"mustafa-stay-alive","why":"regent park wrote this. sit with it."},{"trackId":"frank-ocean-pink-white","why":"for counting the till."},{"trackId":"burial-archangel","why":"the city at 3 a.m. sounds exactly like this."}]},{"kind":"liner","title":"LAST CALL","notes":[{"text":"I hear everyone’s music for eight hours. The ride home is mine. Do not talk to me on the ride home."},{"trackId":"jessie-reyez-figures","text":"She sounds like she’s singing through her teeth. I’ve poured drinks for that exact feeling."}],"stickers":[{"kind":"heart","color":"#4B3A8C","x":0.81,"y":-0.05,"size":54,"rotate":-8}]},{"kind":"shelf","title":"THE RIDE HOME","trackIds":["weeknd-house-of-balloons","burial-archangel","jessie-reyez-figures","mustafa-stay-alive"]},{"kind":"wall","title":"ON THE WALL","trackIds":["mustafa-stay-alive","weeknd-house-of-balloons","frank-ocean-pink-white","burial-archangel","jessie-reyez-figures"],"stickers":[{"kind":"smile","color":"#2C2148","x":0.7000000000000001,"y":0.53,"size":52,"rotate":8}]},{"kind":"guestbook","title":"SIGN HERE","entries":[{"fromId":"ingrid","trackId":"alice-coltrane-satchidananda","why":"the harp comes in and the lake goes flat. i’ve tested this."},{"fromId":"wren","trackId":"bill-evans-peace-piece","why":"six minutes. put the phone down. (you’re holding the phone. i know.)"}]},{"kind":"recent","title":"RECENTLY PLAYED","visibi