  ('arjun', '{"personId":"arjun","theme":{"paper":"#20242B","card":"#2C313A","ink":"#E8E4D8","accent":"#E0533D","highlight":"#3B4350","texture":"grain","displayFont":"typeBold","wall":"grid","layout":"loose"},"sections":[{"kind":"pinned","title":"THE PINNED RECORD","trackId":"deftones-be-quiet","note":"A basement in Unionville, 2011, four of us and one amp between two guitars. We played this badly for an hour. Best the band ever sounded. We broke up in March.","stickers":[{"kind":"bolt","color":"#3B4350","x":0.8500000000000001,"y":-0.1,"size":58,"rotate":3}]},{"kind":"intro","title":"THREE RIFFS I STILL CAN’T PLAY RIGHT","songs":[{"trackId":"deftones-be-quiet","why":"the one we covered. badly."},{"trackId":"mbv-only-shallow","why":"i’ve watched every tutorial. nobody knows."},{"trackId":"turnstile-mystery","why":"the band’s new singer likes this one. it’s fine. i’m fine."}]},{"kind":"wall","title":"THE WALL","trackIds":["deftones-be-quiet","turnstile-mystery","mbv-only-shallow","title-fight-head-in-the-ceiling-fan","radiohead-weird-fishes"],"stickers":[{"kind":"star","color":"#2C313A","x":0.67,"y":0.67,"size":56,"rotate":-17}]},{"kind":"shelf","title":"HEADPHONES ONLY, LIKE AN ADULT","trackIds":["deftones-be-quiet","title-fight-head-in-the-ceiling-fan","radiohead-weird-fishes","mbv-only-shallow"]},{"kind":"liner","title":"BAND MEETING MINUTES","notes":[{"text":"Motion to stop checking their follower count. Motion fails."},{"trackId":"radiohead-weird-fishes","text":"Three guitars playing three different rhythms and somehow it’s one song. We could never."}]},{"kind":"guestbook","title":"GUESTBOOK","entries":[{"fromId":"hyejin","trackId":"yo-la-tengo-autumn-sweater","why":"an organ, a drum loop and a feeling. nobody has topped it since 1997."},{"fromId":"niamh","trackId":"fontaines-starburster","why":"the gasp between lines is the hook. dubliners, obviously."},{"fromId":"owen","trackId":"hip-bobcaygeon","why":"if you grew up here you already know. if you didn’t, this i